        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3" data-aos="fade-up">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">01 / CONVERSION</div>
                    <h3>You're getting traffic, but not enough leads.</h3>
                    <p>Visitors reach your website but too few contact you, request information, or take the next step.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="75">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">02 / EFFICIENCY</div>
                    <h3>Your team keeps doing work manually.</h3>
                    <p>Employees copy data, update spreadsheets, send routine follow-up, create reports, and repeat the same processes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">03 / SYSTEMS</div>
                    <h3>Your technology doesn't work together.</h3>
                    <p>Websites, CRM, marketing tools, software, and data live in separate places and depend on manual handoffs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="225">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-number">04 / SCALE</div>
